M-SEARCH has unescaped "Man" field According to the official docs, the "Man" field's value should be wrapped in quotes. Wrong: ```python data = ( "M-SEARCH * HTTP/1.1
" "HOST:{}
" "MAN: ssdp:discover
" "ST:{}
" "MX:{}
" ).format(host, st, mx) ``` Right: ```python data = ( "M-SEARCH * HTTP/1.1
" "HOST:{}
" 'MAN: "ssdp:discover"
' "ST:{}
" "MX:{}
" ).format(host, st, mx) ```

